#. i18n: file configWidgetUI.ui line 250
#: rc.cpp:68 rc.cpp:223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The CD-ROM device to use when playing CDs. This will typically look "
"something like \"/dev/cdrom\". To have KsCD autodetect your CD-ROM, leave "
"this field empty."
msgstr ""
"Дастгоҳи CD-ROM барои истифода ҳангоми "
"бозикунии Дискҳои Фишурда. Одатан он "
